# S11a, member b (k10, DW4_ONLINE_TEST_DESYNC=1500): one second after a through the gate, then west; at sealed tick 1500
# its engine draws one random number the other machine does not (the desync the vote finds).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@91
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log in the field
route {route:stag0101_west:154,80}
log west
wander 130 88 25 until sealed>=7200 or present=1,frames>=60
log enough
idle until frames>=60
